# api http test requests for VS Code REST Client
@apiUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1

### get cats
GET {{apiUrl}}/cats

### get cat by id
GET {{apiUrl}}/cats/2

### get cat by id (FAIL: not found)
GET {{apiUrl}}/cats/98

### post new cat
POST {{apiUrl}}/cats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cat_name": "Princess Donut",
  "weight": 4.5,
  "owner": "38",
  "filename": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/dungeon-crawler-carl/images/5/56/Donut_by_Mashermello.png/revision/latest?cb=20251024191920",
  "birthdate": "2020-01-01"
}

### post cat WITH IMAGE
POST {{apiUrl}}/cats
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cat_name"

Princess Donut
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="weight"

4.5
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="owner"

Carl
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="birthdate"

2020-01-01
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="cat.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./cat.jpg
--MyBoundary--

### edit existing cat
PUT {{apiUrl}}/cats/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weight": 6,
  "owner": "New owner"
}

### delete cat by id
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/cats/2


### get cats by user id
GET {{apiUrl}}/cats/user/38

